139	    // Tier-A V CSR restore (before GPRs: PB fallback uses x5 as scratch;
140	    // the GPR loop overwrites x5 afterward so state is preserved).
141	    if (state.flags & HYBRID_FLAG_V) {
142	      // V data regfile: reload v0..v31 from the shared scratch region via the
143	      // Program Buffer. Runs BEFORE the architectural V-CSR restore below
144	      // because the sweep's own vsetvl (e8/m8) clobbers vtype/vl/vstart, which
145	      // the restore then overwrites with the architectural values. The sweep
146	      // uses x5/x6/x7 as scratch (x7 is the group base pointer); the GPR loop
147	      // below restores all three. The scratch is vlenb-packed
148	      // (stage_v_to_scratch), so the sweep takes only the runtime vlenb.
149	      if (scratch_gpa_ == kVScratchGpaUnset)
